<a href="#S2.SS1.p2.2" title="2.1 CTMC Forward Process ‣ 2 Preliminaries of Discrete Diffusion Models ‣ Sharp Convergence Rates for Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.1</span></a>,
