</table>
<p id="A3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where both inequalities are due to Jensen’s inequality.
Now we recall an important property for the absorbing score: <math id="A3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{q_{t}(y)}{q_{t}(x)}=\frac{1}{e^{t}-1}q_{0}(y^{i}|x^{UM})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{q_{t}(y)}{q_{t}(x)}=\frac{1}{e^{t}-1}q_{0}(y^{i}|x^{UM})</annotation></semantics></math> where only <math id="A3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y^{i}\neq x^{i}=\mathrm{[MASK]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>≠</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>MASK</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y^{i}\neq x^{i}=\mathrm{[MASK]}</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus, we are able to factor out the explicit time-related coefficient, as follows.
Since <math id="A3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{R}_{t}(x,y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}(x,y)=o(1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.392em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:7.7pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="6.8pt" width="7.7pt"><mi>R</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{R}_{t}(x,y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}(x,y)=o(1)</annotation></semantics></math>, the score estimate also satisfy <math id="A3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{t}(y,x)=\frac{1}{e^{t}-1}\hat{q}_{0}(y^{i}|x^{UM})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{t}(y,x)=\frac{1}{e^{t}-1}\hat{q}_{0}(y^{i}|x^{UM})</annotation></semantics></math> for some time-independent function <math id="A3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{q}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{q}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Then, since <math id="A3.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R(y,x_{k})=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R(y,x_{k})=1</annotation></semantics></math> for such pair of <math id="A3.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x_{k},y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x_{k},y)</annotation></semantics></math>, we can continue as</p>
<table id="A3.Ex18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{TV}^{2}(s;T-t_{k})\lesssim\frac{1}{(e^{t}-1)^{2}}d(S-1)\mathbb{E}_{x_{k}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\sum_{\begin{subarray}{c}y:y\neq x_{k}\\
\text{only}\penalty\ y^{i}\neq x_{k}^{i}=\mathrm{[MASK]}\end{subarray}}\left(\hat{q}_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})-q_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})\right)^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≲</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></msub><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mrow><mtext>only</mtext><mo lspace="0.410em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo>≠</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>MASK</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></munder><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{TV}^{2}(s;T-t_{k})\lesssim\frac{1}{(e^{t}-1)^{2}}d(S-1)\mathbb{E}_{x_{k}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\sum_{\begin{subarray}{c}y:y\neq x_{k}\\
\text{only}\penalty\ y^{i}\neq x_{k}^{i}=\mathrm{[MASK]}\end{subarray}}\left(\hat{q}_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})-q_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})\right)^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">On the other hand, the score-entropy loss at time <math id="A3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> satisfies that</p>
<table id="A3.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{SE}(s;T-t_{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{SE}(s;T-t_{k})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\sum_{y:y\neq x_{k}}\hat{R}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)\log\frac{\hat{R}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)}{\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.392em">−</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:7.7pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="6.8pt" width="7.7pt"><mi>R</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.392em">−</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:7.7pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="6.8pt" width="7.7pt"><mi>R</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:7.7pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="6.8pt" width="7.7pt"><mi>R</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\sum_{y:y\neq x_{k}}\hat{R}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)\log\frac{\hat{R}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)}{\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}(x_{k},y)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{e^{t}-1}\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\sum_{\begin{subarray}{c}y:y\neq x_{k}\\
\text{only}\penalty\ y^{i}\neq x^{i}=\mathrm{[MASK]}\end{subarray}}\hat{q}_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})-q_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})-q_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})\log\frac{\hat{q}_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})}{q_{0}(y^{i}|x_{k}^{UM})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mrow><mtext>only</mtext><mo lspace="0.410em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo>≠</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>MASK</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></munder></mstyle><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><m