<div id="A4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Fix <math id="A4.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[0,T-\delta]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[0,T-\delta]</annotation></semantics></math>.
Here the TV distance can be equivalently expressed as (cf. Remark 4.3 of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">35</a>]</cite>)</p>
