<p id="A4.p6.4" class="ltx_p">where the last line follows because <math id="A4.p6.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{R}_{t}(x,y)\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{R}_{t}(x,y)\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> when <math id="A4.p6.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\neq y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\neq y</annotation></semantics></math>.
Thus,</p>
