<p id="A4.p6.5" class="ltx_p">The proof is now complete.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Proof of <a href="#Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem 2. ‣ 3.2 Convergence Upper Bound for the Euler Method ‣ 3 Convergence Guarantees for the Euler Method ‣ Sharp Convergence Rates for Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a></h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We follow the idea of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite> to analyze the Euler method by constructing a truncated version of the vanilla <math id="A5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-leaping sampler. In Lemma 8 of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite>, it is shown that the truncated <math id="A5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-leaping sampler is asymptotically equivalent to the Euler method. Also, from Lemma 7 of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite>, one important property of this sampler is that its sampling rate <math id="A5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{R}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{R}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is piecewise constant and, given <math id="A5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t_{k}}\in[S]^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t_{k}}\in[S]^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A5.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{R}_{t}(x_{t_{k}},\cdot)=\hat{R}_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}},\cdot)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{R}_{t}(x_{t_{k}},\cdot)=\hat{R}_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}},\cdot).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>Step 1: Decompose total error</h3>

<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As follows we write <math id="A5.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="h_{t}(x_{t}):=\sum_{y:y\neq x_{t}}\left|\hat{R}_{t}(x_{t},y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}(x_{t},y)\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">:=</mo><msub><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.392em">−</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:7.7pt;height:6.8pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="6.8pt" width="7.7pt"><mi>R</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{t}(x_{t}):=\sum_{y:y\neq x_{t}}\left|\hat{R}_{t}(x_{t},y)-\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle R\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle R\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}(x_{t},y)\right|</annotation></semantics></math>. To begin, by <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 3.1 General Decomposition in Total Variation ‣ 3 Convergence Guarantees for the Euler Method ‣ Sharp Convergence Rates for Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, we have</p>
<table id="A5.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex53.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{TV}(\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{T-\delta},p_{T-\delta})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>TV</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:4.8pt;height:6.199999999999999pt;vertical-align:-1.9pt;" depth="1.9pt" height="4.3pt" width="4.8pt"><mi>q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{TV}(\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{T-\delta},p_{T-\delta})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathrm{TV}(\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{0},p_{0})+\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\int_{t_{k}}^{t_{k+1}}\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})\right]\mathrm{d}t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>TV</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:4.8pt;height:6.199999999999999pt;vertical-align:-1.9pt;" depth="1.9pt" height="4.3pt" width="4.8pt"><mi>q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathrm{TV}(\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{0},p_{0})+\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\int_{t_{k}}^{t_{k+1}}\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})\right]\mathrm{d}t</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.Ex55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{\mathrm{TV}(\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{0},p_{0})}_{\text{initialization error}}+\underbrace{\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\left[h_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}})\right]}_{\text{estimation error}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>TV</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:4.8pt;height:6.199999999999999pt;vertical-align:-1.9pt;" depth="1.9pt" height="4.3pt" width="4.8pt"><mi>q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>initialization error</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>estimation error</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{\mathrm{TV}(\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{0},p_{0})}_{\text{initialization error}}+\underbrace{\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\left[h_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}})\right]}_{\text{estimation error}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A5.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+\underbrace{\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\int_{t_{k}}^{t_{k+1}}\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}\\
x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}\end{subarray}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})-h_{t}(x_{t_{k}})\right]+\mathbb{E}_{x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t_{k}})-h_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}})\right]\mathrm{d}t}_{\text{discretization error}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>discretization error</mtext></munder></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+\underbrace{\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\int_{t_{k}}^{t_{k+1}}\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}\\
x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}\end{subarray}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})-h_{t}(x_{t_{k}})\right]+\mathbb{E}_{x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t_{k}})-h_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}})\right]\mathrm{d}t}_{\text{discretization error}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">By <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ 3.2 Convergence Upper Bound for the Euler Method ‣ 3 Convergence Guarantees for the Euler Method ‣ Sharp Convergence Rates for Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Assumption</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, the estimation error satisfies that</p>
<table id="A5.Ex56" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\left[h_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}})\right]\leq\sqrt{\varepsilon_{\text{score-tv}}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>score-tv</mtext></msub></msqrt></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(t_{k+1}-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}}\left[h_{t_{k}}(x_{t_{k}})\right]\leq\sqrt{\varepsilon_{\text{score-tv}}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">It now remains to upper-bound the initialization and the discretization error.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Step 2: Upper-bound initialization error</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following lemma summarizes an upper bound using exact initialization from <math id="A5.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0}=\bm{\delta}_{\mathrm{[MASK]}^{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝜹</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>MASK</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></msup></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0}=\bm{\delta}_{\mathrm{[MASK]}^{d}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 3</span></span><span id="Thmlemma3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmlemma3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Using the absorbing-rate matrix in (<a href="#S2.E3" title="Equation 3 ‣ 2.1 CTMC Forward Process ‣ 2 Preliminaries of Discrete Diffusion Models ‣ Sharp Convergence Rates for Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>), and suppose that <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0}=\bm{\delta}_{\mathrm{[MASK]}^{d}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝛅</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>MASK</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></msup></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0}=\bm{\delta}_{\mathrm{[MASK]}^{d}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A5.Ex57" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex57.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{TV}(q_{T},p_{0})\lesssim de^{-T}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>TV</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≲</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{TV}(q_{T},p_{0})\lesssim de^{-T}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A5.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">See <a href="#A12.SS3" title="L.3 Proof of ‣ Appendix L Proofs of Auxiliary Lemmas ‣ Sharp Convergence Rates for Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">L.3</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>Step 3: Upper-bound discretization error</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As follows, we first show that the first term of the discretization error is small compared to the second term.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 4</span></span><span id="Thmlemma4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Thmlemma4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fix <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=0,\dots,N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=0,\dots,N-1</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[t_{k},t_{k+1})</annotation></semantics></math>.
We have</span></p>
<table id="A5.Ex58" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}\\
x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}\end{subarray}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})-h_{t}(x_{t_{k}})\right]\lesssim(t-t_{k})d\cdot\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})\right]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≲</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}\\
x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}\end{subarray}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})-h_{t}(x_{t_{k}})\right]\lesssim(t-t_{k})d\cdot\mathbb{E}_{x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">See <a href="#A12.SS4" title="L.4 Proof of ‣ Appendix L Proofs of Auxiliary Lemmas ‣ Sharp Convergence Rates for Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">L.4</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Thus, since <math id="A5.SS3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{k+1}-t_{k}\leq\kappa" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{k+1}-t_{k}\leq\kappa</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="A5.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A5.Ex59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex59.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\int_{t_{k}}^{t_{k+1}}\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}x_{t}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t}\\
x_{t_{k}}\sim\mathchoice{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\displaystyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\displaystyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 3.0mu\reflectbox{$\textstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-3.0mu\textstyle q\mkern 3.0mu$}}$}\mkern-3.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}{\mkern 2.0mu\reflectbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\vec{\reflectbox{$\mkern-2.0mu\scriptscriptstyle q\mkern 2.0mu$}}$}\mkern-2.0mu}_{t_{k}}\end{subarray}}\left[h_{t}(x_{t})-h_{t}(x_{t_{k}})\right]\mathrm{d}t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.388em">∼</mo><msub><mpadded style="width:6.5pt;height:7.1pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="7.1pt" width="6.5pt"><mover accent="true"><mpadded style="width:1.7pt;height:2.2pt;vertical-align:-0.7pt;" depth="0.7pt" height="1.5pt" width="1.7pt"><mi mathsize="0.480em">q</mi></mpadded><mo stretchy="false">→</mo></mover></mpadded><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</m